# Thin workspace-docs repo: the sub-projects (lyra/, tree-sitter-lyra/,
# lyra-vscode-ext/, lyra-website/) are their own independent Git repos and must
# NOT be tracked here. Ignore everything by default, then opt in only the
# workspace-level files worth versioning — nothing gets committed by accident.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!lyra.code-workspace
!setup.sh
!setup.ps1
